      "text": "Dr. Gonzales is an Diamond Invisalign Provider in Dublin and Tracy, CA. Invisalign straightens your teeth using series of clear, plastic aligners. Our comprehensive dental care services have helped countless patients achieve their dream smiles. Browse through our before-and-after photos to see the transformative results we’ve achieved for our patients. Every smile tells a story of improved confidence and oral health."
    },
